                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f260d40c-af30-471d-a5fa-3c09f3b7318c",
                                                "sense_id": "a68dbf43-2d1b-371d-8143-7844df8dd240",
                                                "text": "She came down to the kitchen-garden after me, where I went this morning when I had succeeded in straightening myself out a little. […] Antoine I knew was working in the kitchen-garden, a plot of ground hidden from the house at the foot of a steep descent, and I wrent to him and asked to be allowed to help."
                                            }
